CORE libstdcxx
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ noexcept\(false expression\): SUCCESS$
^\[handler\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Fixed: optThrowDecl skipped the expression of noexcept(...); it is now
kept and evaluated when the function type is type-checked (with the
arguments of an instantiation), falling back to non-throwing if it
cannot be evaluated.
